fields.value:
{{Debuffnotes
| name = Rock Throw
| desc = Grants {{A|Primal Beast|Uproar}} stacks as long as {{M|stun}} component is applied on an enemy hero.
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Rock Throw
| desc = Requires drafting {{Symbol|bonus shd}} {{A|Primal Beast|Pulverize}} to unlock this ability.
}}

 * Acquiring {{M|Aghanim's Shard}} unlocks this ability in the {{Spellslot|4|5}}.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** On hover, a red circle appears around the Beast, indicating the ability's min distance.
** Grants {{#var:Rock Throw type2 value2}} {{A|Primal Beast|Uproar}} stack per enemy hero affected by the ability's {{M|stun}}.
*** Considers {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}} and {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes.
*** Does not grant stacks from the following units:
**** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
**** {{M|Hidden}} units.

* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Upon the first projectile impact, another {{#var:Rock Throw type1 value1}} {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-b.png|21px|B]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-r.png|21px|R]] red-circle indicators appear behind the {{Symbol|Target|Area}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] first impact radius, indicating the fragments' impact radius that will happen {{#var:Rock Throw type1 value4}} seconds later.
** [[File:Dota2 Primal Beast Rock Throw Trajectory icon.png|84px|Rock Throw Initial Projectile and Fragments Trajectory.]]
*** {{Code|Area O {{=}} {{#var:Rock Throw value2}}}}
*** {{Code|Area P {{=}} Area B {{=}} Area R {{=}} {{#var:Rock Throw type1 value3}}}}
*** {{Code|[[Wikipedia:Angle|∠]] POB {{=}} ∠ BOR {{=}} 25°}}
*** {{Code|OP {{=}} OB {{=}} OR {{=}} {{#var:Rock Throw type1 value2}}-distance}}
** Both the {{Symbol|Target|Area}} impact radius and the {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}} fragment impact radius indicator is visible ally-only.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Rock Throw icon0}}
| desc = Primal Beast throws a rock at the target location that stuns and damages enemies. The rock cannot be thrown within a minimum range of Primal Beast. After landing, the rock splits into 3 additional fragments that land behind the initial target location.<br><br>Rock Throw increases stacks of Uproar for each hero hit.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Has a fixed travel duration between {{#var:Rock Throw basic1}} and {{#var:Rock Throw basic2}} seconds depending on the target distance which must be between the mininum and the current ability {{M|cast range}}.
** As a result, the projectile speed is between {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{#expr:{{#var:Rock Throw cast range}}/{{#var:Rock Throw basic2}} round0}} and {{#expr:{{#var:Rock Throw value1}}/{{#var:Rock Throw basic1}} round0}}.
*** Any increase in {{M|cast range}} also increases the projectile speed when thrown at max distance.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# The {{M|physical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
*# The {{M|stun}} {{M|debuff}}.
*# Grants self the {{A|Primal Beast|Uproar}} stack per enemy hero hit.

